### Test Kroki Mermaid Diagram

POST http://localhost:8090/mermaid/svg
Content-Type: text/plain

%%{init: {"theme":"default"}}%%
graph TD
    A[Start] --> B{Decision}
    B -->|Yes| C[Option 1]
    B -->|No| D[Option 2]
    C --> E[End]
    D --> E[End]

